OL,4,Aand 'precious' children who died in
OL,5,Afire
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe statement added that "Elisha was a
OL,8,Fdevoted and loving mother" and "our
OL,9,Fbeautiful babies, Leo, Ellis and
OL,10,FPrudence, were loved beyond measure".
